      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あのさあ、月見峠に、毛むくじゃらのでけえ獣が\nウロついててよ、旅人や商人を襲うんだよお。\n腕自慢の奴がいたら、その退治を頼みたい。　\n俺の仲間の仇をとってくれ！　よろしく頼むよお！",
        "official_en": "There's a pair of huge beasts lurkin' around\nMoonwatch Pass, attacking travelers and merchants.\nIf there's anyone around who can do something,\nplease, exterminate them and avenge my friends!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
